      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 54,
      "text": "Slide 1: the library's dissolve, effect apple:dissolve"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 261,
      "text": "Give this body a build in: Animate > Build In > Add an Effect > Appear (Animer > Byg ind > Tilføj en effekt > Vises). Open Build Order (Bygrækkefølge): if the title's Dissolve (Opløs) is not already first, drag it first. Comment on this slide: moved, or pinned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 13,
      "text": "Pinned, still"
    },
